{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":11,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, A ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Psalm"]}," of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 11:1"},"In the LORD put I my trust: How say ye to my soul, Flee ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as "]},"a bird to your mountain? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 11:2"},"For, lo, the wicked bend ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their"]}," bow, they make ready their arrow upon the string, that they may privily shoot at the upright in heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 11:3"},"If the foundations be destroyed, what can the righteous do? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 11:4"},"The LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in his holy temple, the LORD’S throne ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"in heaven: his eyes behold, his eyelids try, the children of men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 11:5"},"The LORD trieth the righteous: but the wicked and him that loveth violence his soul hateth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 11:6"},"Upon the wicked he shall rain snares, fire and brimstone, and an horrible tempest: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["this shall be"]}," the portion of their cup. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 11:7"},"For the righteous LORD loveth righteousness; his countenance doth behold the upright. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 11:7"}]}]}
